# Eval run envelopes (#1333). The nightly's `eval-results/<runId>.json` and
# `eval-results/answer-correctness/*.json` are now tracked, so lint-staged would
# otherwise run prettier over machine-written artifacts on every local commit
# that touches them. They are byte-stable output of `JSON.stringify(_, null, 2)`
# and must stay that way — a reformat would show as a spurious diff on history
# nobody edited. Same reasoning as graphify-out/ above.
